      ],
      "source": "https://www.bacacountyco.gov/towns/two-buttes/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A dam on Two Buttes Creek created the reservoir that once powered the town’s early growth and now serves local boating.",
